    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "SERVED ALOFT\nABOARD THE MAINLINER\nMenu",
      "Мепи =\nLos Angeles\nMelon Cocktail, Parisienne\nBaked Turkey Casserole with Dressing\nNew Peas\nParkerhouse Rolls\nMainliner Vegetable Salad\nFrench Dressing\nIce Cream\nCookies\nCoffee\nTea\nMints\nMilk\nUnited Air Lines' pilots are front-rank pioneers in\nthe big business of air transportation. One, Captain\nE. Hamilton Lee, dean of all the world's pilots, flew\nthe original 1918 air mail run New York and Wash-\nington, and has almost 4,000,000 miles of flying to\nhis credit.\nUNITED\nAIR\nLINES"
    ],
